- Main run `37132155004` completed native candidate image build. The verifier
  observed HTTP 401, `error.code: "AUTH_002"`, and no `error.type`; GHCR login
  and publication were skipped, so no image was published. Read-only diagnosis
  traced the direct request through `classify.ts:95`, `proxy.ts:23`,
  `runAuthzPipeline`, `clientApi.ts:61`, and `pipeline.ts:62`: required-key
  middleware rejects before the catalog handler and emits code without type.
  The prior `invalid_api_key` prediction missed that path. Keep
