  regression failed before the fix; focused tests pass 8/8. Scoped ESLint with
  `--no-ignore`, Prettier, generated-browser-script syntax, and
  `git diff --check` pass. Code Simplifier and independent static review found
  no further simplifications or high-confidence findings.
- Main run `37138784470` built the backend and Playwright Chromium, then the
  candidate Docker healthcheck became unhealthy with
  `172.17.0.3: fetch failed`; GHCR login/publication were skipped. The logs do
  not expose image command config, and API, browser, and UI checks are not
  proven. Static inspection found that `runtime-web` replaced `ENTRYPOINT`
